},{"text":"Turbidity"},{"text":"Sinkholes"},{"text":"New wet areas"},{"text":"Unexpected flow"},{"text":"Changes in piezometer readings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These require engineering investigation rather than assumptions based on a single observation."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Spillways"},{"type":"p","text":"Spillways are critical for flood safety."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ogee spillways"},{"text":"Chute spillways"},{"text":"Side-channel spillways"},{"text":"Shaft spillways"},{"text":"Labyrinth spillways"},{"text":"Gates"},{"text":"Energy dissipation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Extreme Inflow","Reservoir Rise","Spillway","Energy Dissipation","Safe Downstream Discharge"]},{"type":"h","text":"Spillway Hydraulic Problems"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cavitation"},{"text":"Air entrainment"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Hydraulic jumps"},{"text":"Scour"},{"text":"Erosion"},{"text":"Gate malfunction"},{"text":"Blockage"},{"text":"Debris effects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Flood Routing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reservoir routing"},{"text":"Level-pool routing"},{"text":"Muskingum concepts"},{"text":"Inflow hydrograph"},{"text":"Outflow hydrograph"},{"text":"Storage relationships"},{"text":"Spillway discharge"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Concept:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Flood Inflow","Reservoir Storage","Water Level","Spillway / Outlet","Downstream Outflow"]},{"type":"h","text":"Reservoir Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rule curves"},{"text":"Conservation storage"},{"text":"Flood cushion"},{"text":"Dead storage"},{"text":"Live storage"},{"text":"Spillway operation"},{"text":"Drawdown"},{"text":"Seasonal operation"},{"text":"Water-supply requirements"},{"text":"Irrigation releases"},{"text":"Hydropower requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Dam safety must be considered alongside com