"},{"type":"p","text":"FLOOD MODELLING"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"RESERVOIR OPERATIONS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SEEPAGE ANALYSIS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SOIL / GEOTECHNICAL ENGINEERING"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"DAM INSTRUMENTATION"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"STRUCTURAL HEALTH MONITORING"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"RISK ASSESSMENT"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"DAM INSPECTION"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"EMERGENCY PLANNING"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"HEC-RAS / HEC-HMS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"PYTHON / EXCEL"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"REMOTE SENSING"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"DIGITAL TWINS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI / PREDICTIVE MONITORING"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By the end of B.Tech/B.E., the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analyze hydrological systems"},{"text":"Perform rainfall-runoff analysis"},{"text":"Analyze flood frequency"},{"text":"Understand design-flood concepts"},{"text":"Perform basic flood routing"},{"text":"Understand reservoir operation"},{"text":"Analyze open-channel flow"},{"text":"Understand dam components"},{"text":"Analyze basic dam loading"},{"text":"Understand concrete and embankment dam behaviour"},{"text":"Perform basic seepage analysis"},{"text":"Understand piping and internal erosion"},{"text":"Analyze slope stability fundamentals"},{"text":"Understand spillway hydraulics"},{"text":"Interpret dam instrumentation"},{"text":"Analyze piezometer and seepage data"},{"text":"Understand deformation monitoring"},{"text":"Conduct structured dam inspections under supervision"},{"text":"Perform basic risk and failure-mode analysis"},{"text":"Understand emergency action planning"},{"text":"Use GIS for flood and inundation mapping"},{"text":"Use HEC-RAS/related tools for hydraulic modelling"},{"text":"Use Python for hydrological data analysis"},{"text":"Build dam-monitoring dashboards"},{"text":"Understand remote sensing and drone-based inspection"},{"text":"Understand digital-dam and structural-health-monitoring concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain 5–7 substantial water-infrastructure projects."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Flood Routing Project"},{"type":"flow","items":["Rainfall/streamflow","Inflow Hydrograph","Reservoir","Spillway","Outflow"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Dam Seepage Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Model:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reservoir level"},{"text":"Hydraulic head"},{"text":"Pore pressure"},{"text":"Seepage"},{"text":"Drainage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Dam Instrumentation Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reservoir level"},{"text":"Piezometers"},{"text":"Seepage"},{"text":"Deformation"},{"text":"Temperature"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Dam-Break Inundation Mapping"},{"type":"flow","items":["DEM","Dam-Break Scenario","Hydraulic Model","Flood Extent","Depth / Velocity","GIS Risk Map"]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Dam Risk Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform a structured assessment of potential failure modes and consequences for a hypothetical dam."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Remote Dam Inspection"},{"type":"p","text":"Use drone imagery or a suitable public dataset to demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Crack detection"},{"text":"Surface deterioration"},{"text":"Erosion"},{"text":"Change detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Digital Dam Twin"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS","reservoir model","instrumentation","structural monitoring","dashboard"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"A water resources engineering professional specializing in dam safety, combining hydrology, hydraulic engineering, dam and geotechnical fundamentals, seepage analysis, flood modelling, reservoir operations, instrumentation, structural health monitoring, risk assessment, GIS and digital technologies to support the safe and reliable lifecycle management of water-retaining infrastructure."},{"type":"h","text":"Strongest positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hydrology","Dam Engineering","Instrumentation","Risk","GIS/Hydraulic Modelling","Digital Monitoring"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest progression is:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Water Resources/Hydrology → Water Resources/Dam Safety Trainee → Junior Dam Safety Engineer → Dam Safety Engineer → Senior Dam Safety Specialist → Dam Safety Lead/Manager → Water Infrastructure Safety & Asset Management Leadership."}]}]}